OL,3,GNEWSABomb-littered beach throws up more
OL,4,Aexplosive finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree suspected explosive items found
OL,7,Fon a beach where several shells are
OL,8,Fother ordnance have been discovered
OL,9,Fover the past year, are due to be
OL,10,Fdestroyed.
OL,12,FCoastguard rescue teams and a bomb
OL,13,Fsquad unit were called to Drigg beach,
OL,14,Fabout seven miles south of the
OL,15,FSellafield nuclear facility on
OL,16,FCumbria's Irish Sea coast, on Tuesday
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40102
