OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1789633713
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABomb-littered beach throws up more
OL,4,Aexplosive finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the items were assessed it was
OL,7,Fdecided an explosive ordnance disposal
OL,8,Funit team would aim to carry out a
OL,9,Fcontrolled explosion on Thursday,
OL,10,FMillom Coastguard Rescue Team said.
OL,12,FFive suspected explosive items were
OL,13,Fdestroyed on the same beach earlier
OL,14,Fthis month, while a number of artillery
OL,15,Fshells and mortars were found in the
OL,16,Farea last year.
